  "name": "metube",
  "category": "file",
  "description": "MeTube 是一个基于 youtube-dl/yt-dlp 的 Web GUI 视频下载器，支持 YouTube 等数千个站点的视频/音频下载。",
  "version": "latest",
  "logo": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alexta69/metube/master/README/screenshot.png",
  "website": "https://github.com/alexta69/metube",
  "tutorial": "访问地址：http://服务器IP:8081\n粘贴视频链接即可下载，文件保存到 ./downloads。\n无登录认证，建议部署在内网或加反代鉴权。",
  "dotenv": "",
  "compose": "services:\n  metube:\n    image: ghcr.io/alexta69/metube:latest\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      - \"8081:8081\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./downloads:/downloads\n    environment:\n      - THEME=Dark\n      - DOWNLOAD_DIR=/downloads",
